(* The fault is always surfaced. Expected: TRUE.

   Every path on which APP_PARTIAL_SUBMISSION occurs must be able to reach
   WRITE_ERROR_SHOWN. A specification that let the system fail silently would
   make silence CONFORMANT under ioco, which is the opposite of the intended
   reading -- and is why divergence appears nowhere in this model.
*)
< true* . "APP_PARTIAL_SUBMISSION" > < true* . "WRITE_ERROR_SHOWN" > true
